The arm64 guards accept the compiler spelling too (aarch64 port, task A4)

Same parenthesized sweep as xnu patch 0019, for the duct-tape kernel the daemon compiles
with a plain aarch64-linux clang. Applies after 0003 so it also covers the arm shims it
adds. Symlinks skipped; every __arm64__ test also accepts __aarch64__.

